    "help.full_disk_access_scope": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n请在系统设置中手动授予完整磁盘访问权限。APFSearch 只读取已挂载、已解锁且有权限访问的文件，不会自动下载云端文件。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\nGrant Full Disk Access manually in System Settings. APFSearch reads only mounted, unlocked, accessible files and does not automatically download cloud files."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n請在系統設定中手動授予完整磁碟存取權限。APFSearch 只讀取已掛載、已解鎖且有權限存取的檔案，不會自動下載雲端檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "help.query_syntax_details": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空格：同时包含   |：任一包含   !：排除\n\"项目 文档\"：完整短语   <图片 | 文档>：分组\next:pdf;docx   folder:   file:   path:Documents\nsize:>10mb   dm:today   regex:^报告.*\\.pdf$\ncontent:\"关键词\"：搜索文件内容（可能需要较长时间）\n\n点击列标题排序；按住 ⇧ 添加排序列。\n空格预览，回车打开，⌘⇧C 复制路径。\n宏、书签和排除路径可以在设置中管理。\nWindows 专属属性会显示不适用，不会静默忽略。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Space: AND   |: OR   !: NOT\n\"project document\": phrase   <image | document>: group\next:pdf;docx   folder:   file:   path:Documents\nsize:>10mb   dm:today   regex:^report.*\\.pdf$\ncontent:\"keyword\": search file contents (may take longer)\n\nClick a column heading to sort; hold ⇧ to add a sort column.\nSpace previews, Return opens, and ⌘⇧C copies paths.\nManage macros, bookmarks, and exclusions in Settings.\nWindows-only properties report unsupported rather than being silently ignored."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空白鍵：同時包含   |：任一包含   !：排除\n\"項目 文件\"：完整短語   <圖片 | 文件>：分組\next:pdf;docx   folder:   file:   path:Documents\nsize:>10mb   dm:today   regex:^報告.*\\.pdf$\ncontent:\"關鍵詞\"：搜尋檔案內容（可能需要較長時間）\n\n按一下列標題排序；按住 ⇧ 添加排序列。\n空白鍵預覽，Return打開，⌘⇧C 複製路徑。\n宏、書簽和排除路徑可以在設定中管理。\nWindows 專屬屬性會顯示不適用，不會靜默忽略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "help.query_syntax_summary": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查询语法：空格表示同时包含，| 表示任一，! 表示排除。支持 ext:、size:、dm:、regex: 和 content:。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Query syntax: spaces mean AND, | means OR, and ! means NOT. Supported functions include ext:, size:, dm:, regex:, and content:."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查詢語法：空白鍵表示同時包含，| 表示任一，! 表示排除。支持 ext:、size:、dm:、regex: 和 content:。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
